This is a breaking change that cannot be done in already released minor version. All clients referring to `TranslationInput` would break. Example mutation below.

```
  mutation TranslateCategory(
    $id: ID!
    $languageCode: LanguageCodeEnum!
    $input: TranslationInput!
  ) {
    categoryTranslate(id: $id, languageCode: $languageCode, input: $input) {
      errors { field code message }
    }
  }
```

`TranslationInput` becomes `CategoryTranslationInput`.

